{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Living Longer Better"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Living Longer"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 11}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes short texts using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes short texts using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Writes short texts using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le11ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Writing About Health"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When writing short informative texts, you can use discourse markers to connect your ideas."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discourse markers are words and phrases that help to develop ideas and relate them to each other. You use discourse markers in writing more than speaking as they tend to sound more formal."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discourse markers usually come at the beginning of the sentence, marked with a comma (,)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart for some examples of discourse markers:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Discourse Marker\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Nevertheless\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"But, However, Even though\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Indeed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"In fact\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Furthermore\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"And, Also\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"In addition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" And, Also\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Therefore\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"As a result\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Nevertheless, many experts think that certain foods prolong life."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Therefore, people had better eat more of these foods."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Offering Advice and Solutions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can often use <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> with little difference in meaning when you give advice, make a recommendation or give a solution to a situation. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "People ought to/should exercise more to improve their heart health."}, {"type": "example", "content": "People ought to/should eat healthier to fight the aging process."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "process"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the way that something is done "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Many people try to fight the aging process."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob08aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to write about health. "}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "desperate "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "showing hopelessness about a situation that cannot be changed "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Charlie Chaplin was desperate in his attempt to stay young."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob08aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "injection"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a process by which a liquid is put into the body using a needle"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Chaplin had special injections to help him stay young."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob08aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cell"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the smallest part of a living organism "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Chaplin had injections of goat cells."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob08aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "goat"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an animal with horns, usually living on a farm "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My father had many goats on his farm."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob08aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "deterioration "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the process of becoming worse  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vitamins help slow down the deterioration of the body."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob08aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vitamin "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a group of organic compounds necessary for healthy growth of body and mind "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vitamins C and E are important to fight the aging process."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le11ob08aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write down 6 words about health on 6 different squares of paper. They can be verbs, nouns, adjectives..."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Your partner will also write 6 words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Mix up all the squares together."}, {"type": "text", "content": "One person will choose a word and try to talk as long as possible using that word as a topic/starting point."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you can't think of more to say, your partner will choose the next word."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write down 6 words about health."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use a word as a starting point for a conversation about health."}, {"type": "text", "content": "My partner and I take turns talking about health."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can write about staying healthy."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can write about experiences I've had or haven't had."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can write about advice and solutions."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Have you ever done anything crazy to stay young and healthy?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What about celebrities in your country? What do they do to stay young and healthy?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Writing Spot: Do you believe in the fountain of youth?"}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\"> Nowadays</span>, what should people do to fight the aging process?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"cont