hem.</span> <br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Write about different ways to stay young and healthy.</span> <br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Use discourse markers, if you can.</span> <br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Look at these examples from the audio:</span></span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<style>\ndiv.CSindent  {margin-left: 3em;}\n</style>\n<div class=CSindent>\nMany experts think that certain foods may help slow down the deterioration caused by age. Indeed, certain vitamins, such as vitamins E and C, seem to have this effect. Therefore, people ought to eat more foods, like spinach, nuts and fruit, containing these vitamins.<br/>\nIf people really want to extend their lives, they had better exercise. Exercise causes the muscles, the heart, and the lungs to all work better. \n</div>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"bullet italic\">When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task button</span>.<br/>"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Activity 3"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "You are done!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Did you complete your opinion text?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br/>Make sure to include: \n<ul><li>100 words. </li>\n<li>Discourse markers.</li>\n<li>Advice and solutions.</li>\n<li>Your opinion.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your text for spelling, grammar and punctuation errors."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Click the <span class=\"strong\">Submit</span> button to save yo