ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le11ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le11ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Over the years, people have tried to fight against the aging process in different ways. Some famous people have done desperate things in their fight against old age. For example, Charlie Chaplin and Christian Dior tried to stay young by getting injections that had cells from goats!"}, {"time": "17000", "image": "engenn6le11ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "Nowadays, many scientists think that proper diet is one of the secrets of long life. So far they have proven this to be true only in regards to animals. They have not gathered enough evidence to prove that this is also true for humans. Nonetheless, many experts think that certain foods may help slow down the deterioration caused by age. Indeed, certain vitamins, such as vitamins E and C, seem to have this effect. Therefore, people ought to eat more foods, like spinach, nuts and fruit, containing these vitamins."}, {"time": "53000", "image": "engenn6le11ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "If people really want to extend their lives, they had better exercise. Exercise causes the muscles, the heart, and the lungs to all work better."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le11ob08re6img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le11ob08re6aud06", "images": []}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "text": "Writing Short Informative Texts <br><br>\nUse discourse markers to develop ideas and relate them to each other. <br>\nSome examples are:<br>\nNevertheless, Indeed, Furthermore, In addition, Therefore", "id": 0}], "video_src": "engenn6le11ob08re3vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 3, "_data": 